        "Title": "The Grand Masters",
        "Location": "LOCATION_MIAMI",
        "PublicId": "111058636751",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/miami/scene_flamingo.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 84afa070-b860-4855-9703-23f2e4e622c1).Image",
        "Description": "Today 47 our target is also our oldest allie. Its a group called the grand Masters from Switzerland.  We have often worked together and they have supplied us with the best weapons you could get yourhands on for centuries. Now we found out thay supplied Arthur Edwards aswell, stabbing us in the back. Today their henchmen are going to supply the Knoxes with the brand new modern Jager 7. Kill the hench men to send the grand Masters a message.\r\rI will leave you to prepare, good luck 47.",
